          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 73670,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mari pelajari cara menambahkan dan menghapus nilai dengan array. Seperti aplikasi daftar tugas ini, yang menggunakan array untuk menambahkan dan menghapus tugas.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;&#xA;&lt;head&gt;&#xA;    &lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;title&gt;To-Do List&lt;/title&gt;&#xA;    &lt;style&gt;&#xA;        body {&#xA;            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&#xA;            display: flex;&#xA;            justify-content: center;&#xA;            align-items: center;&#xA;            margin: 0;&#xA;            background-color: #f5f5f5;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .todo-container {&#xA;            background-color: white;&#xA;            padding: 20px;&#xA;            border-radius: 10px;&#xA;            margin: 24px auto;&#xA;            box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);&#xA;        }&#xA;        h1 {&#xA;            font-size: 24px;&#xA;            margin-bottom: 20px;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .todo-item {&#xA;            display: flex;&#xA;            align-items: center;&#xA;            margin-bottom: 10px;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .todo-item input[type=&quot;checkbox&quot;] {&#xA;            width: 20px;&#xA;            height: 20px;&#xA;            margin-right: 10px;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .todo-item.completed span {&#xA;            text-decoration: line-through;&#xA;            color: #ccc;&#xA;        }&#xA;    &lt;/style&gt;&#xA;&lt;/head&gt;&#xA;&lt;body&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&quot;todo-container&quot;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h1&gt;To-Dos&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&quot;todo-item&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot; id=&quot;todo-1&quot; checked&gt;&#xA;            &lt;span&gt;buy clear nail polish 💅&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&quot;todo-item&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot; id=&quot;todo-2&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;span&gt;buy soap bar 🧼&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&quot;todo-item&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot; id=&quot;todo-3&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;span&gt;paint soap with nail-polish&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&quot;todo-item&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot; id=&quot;todo-4&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;span&gt;casually leave soap in bathroom&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&quot;todo-item&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot; id=&quot;todo-5&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;span&gt;enjoy&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;script&gt;&#xA;        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {&#xA;            const checkboxes = document.querySelectorAll('.todo-item input[type=&quot;checkbox&quot;]');&#xA;            checkboxes.forEach(checkbox =&gt; {&#xA;                checkbox.addEventListener('change', function() {&#xA;                    if (this.checked) {&#xA;                        this.parentNode.classList.add('completed');&#xA;                    } else {&#xA;                        this.parentNode.classList.remove('completed');&#xA;                    }&#xA;                });&#xA;            });&#xA;&#xA;            checkboxes.forEach(checkbox =&gt; {&#xA;                if (checkbox.checked) {&#xA;                    checkbox.parentNode.classList.add('completed');&#xA;                }&#xA;            });&#xA;        });&#xA;    &lt;/script&gt;&#xA;&lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Push",
            "id": 73671,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk menambahkan nilai seperti <code>\"groceries\"</code> ke array, tulis nama array <code>toDo</code>, diikuti titik <code>.</code>, lalu method array <code>push(\"groceries\")</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toDo.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;groceries&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toDo);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"59\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'call mom', 'dishes', 'groceries' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>toDo</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, dan terakhir <code>push(\"groceries\")</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan nilai dengan method <code>toDo.push(\"groceries\")</code>. Tambahkan tugas agar array berakhir dengan <code>\"groceries\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toDo.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;groceries&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toDo);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pop(&quot;groceries&quot;)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"tasks\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"push(groceries)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'call mom', 'dishes', 'groceries' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>toDo</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, dan terakhir <code>push(\"groceries\")</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "End of the array",
            "id": 73672,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Menambahkan nilai dengan metode <code>.push()</code> menempatkannya di akhir array.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toDo.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;groceries&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toDo);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"groceries\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'call mom', 'dishes', 'groceries' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"groceries\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Method <code>.push()</code> menambahkan nilai ke akhir array. Jadikan <code>\"groceries\"</code> sebagai nilai terakhir yang ditampilkan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toDo.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;groceries&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toDo);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"groceries\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pop\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'call mom', 'dishes', 'groceries' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>push</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\"groceries\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "More values",
            "id": 73673,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita dapat menambahkan beberapa nilai dengan <code>.push()</code> dengan memisahkannya menggunakan koma <code>,</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toDo.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;groceries&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;feed cat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toDo);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'call mom', 'dishes', 'groceries', 'feed cat' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan beberapa nilai dengan <code>.push()</code> dan pisahkan dengan koma <code>,</code>. Tambahkan kedua tugas agar <code>\"feed cat\"</code> berada terakhir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toDo.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;groceries&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;feed cat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toDo);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'call mom', 'dishes', 'groceries', 'feed cat' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Pop",
            "id": 73674,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk menghapus elemen terakhir dari array, kita menulis nama array <code>toDo</code>, titik <code>.</code>, dan metode array <code>pop()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toDo.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toDo);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"push\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'call mom' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>toDo</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, lalu <code>pop</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Store removed element",
            "id": 73676,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Saat kita menetapkan <code>toDo.pop()</code> ke sebuah variabel, variabel tersebut menyimpan nilai yang sedang kita hapus.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" chore = toDo.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(chore);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"dishes\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>chore</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Variabel yang diberi <code>toDo.pop()</code> menyimpan nilai yang dihapus. Simpan nilai itu di <code>chore</code> dan tampilkan <code>dishes</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" chore = toDo.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(chore);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"toDo\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"dishes\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>chore</code>, diikuti oleh <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Push",
            "id": 73870,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Metode apa yang kita gunakan untuk menambahkan nilai ke array?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>.push()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>.pop()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>.push()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sebuah array berisi <code>\"call mom\"</code>. Pemanggilan mana yang menambahkan <code>\"groceries\"</code> tanpa menghapus apa pun?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>.push()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>.pop()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>.shift()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>.push()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: End of the array",
            "id": 73871,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ke mana nilai baru yang kita tambahkan dengan <code>.push()</code> pergi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Di akhir array</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Di awal array</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Di akhir array.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mulai dengan <code>[\"call mom\", \"dishes\"]</code>, lalu gunakan <code>.push(\"groceries\")</code>. Di mana <code>\"groceries\"</code> berada?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Di akhir array</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Di awal array</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nilai tersebut menggantikan nilai terakhir</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih Di akhir array.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: More values",
            "id": 73872,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Berapa banyak nilai yang bisa kita tambahkan ke array menggunakan <code>.push()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sebanyak yang kita mau</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hanya satu nilai setiap kali</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sebanyak yang kita mau.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang dapat ditambahkan <code>toDo.push(\"groceries\", \"feed cat\")</code> dalam satu pemanggilan method ini?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Kedua nilai</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hanya nilai pertama</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Hanya satu nilai karena <code>.push()</code> menerima satu nilai</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih Kedua nilai.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Pop",
            "id": 73873,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Metode apa yang kita gunakan untuk menghapus elemen terakhir dari array?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>.pop()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>.push()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>.pop()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sebuah array berakhir dengan <code>\"dishes\"</code>. Method mana yang menghapus elemen terakhir tersebut?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>.pop()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>.push()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>.shift()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>.pop()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Store removed element",
            "id": 73874,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana cara menyimpan nilai yang dihapus oleh <code>.pop()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dengan menyimpannya dalam variabel</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Kita tidak bisa menyimpannya karena <code>.pop()</code> tidak mengembalikan nilai</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dengan menyimpannya dalam variabel.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Setelah <code>const removed = toDo.pop()</code>, apa yang disimpan <code>removed</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nilai yang terakhir berada di <code>toDo</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Array setelah nilai terakhirnya dihapus</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Tidak ada karena <code>.pop()</code> tidak mengembalikan nilai</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nilai yang terakhir berada di <code>toDo</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Push",
            "id": 73876,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan <code>\"joe\"</code> ke array pengguna aktif.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" activeUsers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;mike&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"activeUsers.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(activeUsers);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".pop()\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'sue', 'mike', 'joe' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>activeUsers</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.push(\"joe\")</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Array harus menampilkan <code>[ 'sue', 'mike', 'joe' ]</code>. Tambahkan <code>\"joe\"</code> tanpa menghapus pengguna aktif lain.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" activeUsers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;mike&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"activeUsers.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(activeUsers);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"users\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".pop()\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".push(joe)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'sue', 'mike', 'joe' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>activeUsers</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.push(\"joe\")</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: End of the array",
            "id": 73877,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan <code>\"sugar\"</code> ke akhir array dengan menulis kode <code>.push(\"sugar\")</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" cookies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;flour&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;butter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"cookies.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(cookies);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"58\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'flour', 'butter', 'sugar' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>.push(\"sugar\")</code>.</p></body></html>"
